cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MONICA
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Faino
    given-names: Luigi
    affiliation: Department of Environmental Biology, Sapienza University of Rome
repository-code: https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/monica
abstract: >-
  Detection and quantification of plant pathogens from Nanopore amplicon
  sequencing: read filtering and trimming, optional correction and assembly,
  blast against a nucleotide database and taxonomic assignment with the NCBI
  taxonomy, with Krona, abundance and diversity reports.
keywords:
  - nanopore
  - metabarcoding
  - plant pathogens
  - amplicon sequencing
version: 5.0.0
license: REPLACE-ME
